OL,3,AFailed asylum seeker jailed for life
OL,4,Aover knife attack attempt at Israeli
OL,5,Aembassy in London
OL,6,
OL,7,FA failed asylum seeker who tried to
OL,8,Fbreak into the Israeli embassy in
OL,9,FLondon to carry out a knife attack has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed for life with a minimum
OL,11,Fterm of 20 years.
OL,13,FAbdullah Albadri was carrying two
OL,14,Fknives when police officers caught him
OL,15,Fas he tried to climb over a fence into
OL,16,Fthe Kensington embassy on 28 April
OL,17,F2025.
OL,19,FThe 34-year-old from Kuwait had arrived
OL,20,Fin the UK on a small boat 16 days
OL,21,Fearlier, having first entered country
OL,22,Fillegally four years earlier.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
